-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The admit card has released<strong data-end=\"393\" data-start=\"336\"> before the PST (Physical Measurement Test)</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is it mandatory to <strong>carry the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, <strong data-end=\"1033\" data-start=\"986\">without the admit card entry is not allowed</strong> at the PMT venue.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Can I show the <strong>admit card on mobile?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> No, only a <strong data-end=\"1420\" data-start=\"1404\">printed copy</strong> is accepted.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What if there is an <strong>error in the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answ<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">er: Contact <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Haryana Staff Selection Commission</span></span> immedia